 also be used for a maximum of one week if used in combination with antidepressants to allow for the antidepressant medication to take effect. Ensure to taper off the medication gradually when stopping.", "runs": [{"text": "Benzodiazepines"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "period,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "maximum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "duration"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "two"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "weeks,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "drugs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "have"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "strong propensity for addiction. They can also be used for a maximum of one week if used in combination with antidepressants to allow for the antidepressant medication to take effect. Ensure to taper off the medication gradually when stopping."}]}, {"id": "body-27476", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "C: diazepam 5–10 mg PO at night for a maximum of 2 weeks", "runs": [{"text": "C:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "diazepam"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "5–10"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "PO"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "night"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "maximum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "2"}, {"text": " weeks"}]}, {"id": "body-27477", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-27478", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "C: lorazepam 1–2 mg PO at night for a maximum of 2 weeks", "runs": [{"text": "C",